     * - `page`: Page number for pagination (1-indexed)
     * - `limit`: Number of comments per page (max: 1000)
     *
     * # Returns
     * - `Ok(Vec<TraktComment>)`: List of comments
     * - `Err(String)`: Error message if the request fails
